license: CC-BY-4.0

abstract: >
  BraDengue-MM is a nationwide municipal-level multimodal dataset for dengue surveillance, 
  nowcasting, and prospective forecasting in Brazil covering the period 2010–2025. 
  The dataset integrates epidemiological, meteorological, precipitation, remote sensing, 
  ENSO climate indices, topographic, land-cover, demographic, and sanitation information.

